{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"402f8682-136b-4045-b600-0d81017e67e7","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The root causes have been identified, fixed, verified with tests, and documented in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-Gyfxdp/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Root Causes\n1. **Prod crash (`logs/prod-error.log`)**: In [`StoryLibrary.hide`](file:///tmp/h-Gyfxdp/src/app.py#L54), `UpdateExpression=\"SET hidden = :h, ...\"` used the bare attribute name `hidden`, which is a reserved keyword in DynamoDB. This caused DynamoDB to reject the operation with a `ValidationException`.\n2. **Staging feed leakage (`logs/bug-report.md`)**: In [`StoryLibrary.feed`](file:///tmp/h-Gyfxdp/src/app.py#L63), `ProjectionExpression=\"slug, title, hidden, published_at\"` also used bare `hidden`. In DynamoDB, bare reserved keywords in projection expressions do not throw an error; instead, DynamoDB silently drops the field from returned items. As a result, `item.get(\"hidden\")` returned `None`, making `not item.get(\"hidden\")` evaluate to `True` for every item, and the feed filter failed to exclude hidden stories.\n\n### Changes Made\n- Updated all DynamoDB expressions in [src/app.py](file:///tmp/h-Gyfxdp/src/app.py) (`publish`, `rename`, `hide`, `feed`, and `archive`) to use `#alias` placeholders with `ExpressionAttributeNames` across `UpdateExpression`, `ProjectionExpression`, and `ConditionExpression`.\n- Added unit tests in [tests/test_feed.py](file:///tmp/h-Gyfxdp/tests/test_feed.py) testing `hide()`, verifying that hidden stories are excluded from `feed()`, and testing `archive()`.\n- Documented causes and an analysis of which parts of the colleague's note applied versus were ignored in [ANSWER.md](file:///tmp/h-Gyfxdp/ANSWER.md).\n","duration_seconds":64.07663,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":163687,"output_tokens":3744,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":129886,"total_tokens":167431}}}
